Package: linuxcnc-notify
Version: 0.1.2
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.7), ca-certificates, linuxcnc-uspace (>= 2.8) | python3-linuxcnc
Recommends: qrencode
Maintainer: bucklevision <bucklevision@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/bucklevision/linuxcnc-notify
Description: Read-only remote notifications for LinuxCNC
 Monitors the standard LinuxCNC status interface and sends program stop,
 pause, machine state, limit, drive and interpreter fault notifications to
 an ntfy-compatible HTTPS service. Includes automatic topic generation,
 pairing commands and a local status page. It never controls LinuxCNC.
